# FIXED DEFECT 2128, 2026-10-18, lane lane-readonly-lend (M-readonly-lend
# step 7; panel 224's R4 filed it apart).
#
# SYMPTOM: this module's `K_SHIFT` was told alone at exit 1, and `K_DIV` of
# `fixedbugs2128/values`, a unit that compiles, on the next build.
#
# CAUSE: the probe was asked only once every unit had compiled, and the
# other module's unit, which did, was never asked.
#
# FIX: every unit that compiled is asked beside the refusal
# (`cli/value_beside.hero`).
use fixedbugs2128/values

extern "fixedbugs-2128-values.h"
    constant K_SHIFT: i64  #~ ffi_constant_type

function main()
    print(K_SHIFT + values.divided())
